{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"d89bfb24-261a-4624-aa53-1b8927d98356","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented the required analytics events on the registration and offers screens, using the existing `Analytics` wrapper.\n\n**Key changes**\n- Added import of `analytics.dart` in `registration_screen.dart`.\n- Introduced boolean flags (`_emailStartedFired`, `_phoneStartedFired`, `_termsAcceptedFired`) to ensure events fire only once per screen visit.\n- Updated email \u0026 phone `onChanged` callbacks to capture `registration_email_started` and `registration_phone_started` events respectively, guarded by the flags.\n- Modified the slider to capture `loan_amount_changed` on `onChangeEnd` (still updates UI via `onChanged`).\n- Added analytics captures for:\n  - `terms_accepted` when the checkbox is checked.\n  - `registration_continue_tapped` when the Continue button is pressed, sending `amount` and `terms` properties.\n- Converted `OfferScreen` to a `StatefulWidget` with a `ScrollController` and a `NotificationListener\u003cScrollEndNotification\u003e` that sends `offers_scrolled` with the final scroll offset.\n- Updated `offer_screen.dart` imports to include `analytics.dart`.\n\n**Documentation**\nAll implementation details are recorded in the artifact **ANSWER.md** located at:\n\n`/Users/valentinakoniukhova/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/d89bfb24-261a-4624-aa53-1b8927d98356/ANSWER.md`\n\n**Relevant parts of colleague’s note used**\n- Flag‑based one‑time event firing for text fields.\n- Moving slider events to `onChangeEnd`.\n- Using `ScrollEndNotification` for scroll events.\n- General pattern of capturing events only after the interaction completes.\n","duration_seconds":155.151159,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":32080,"output_tokens":14126,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":488192,"total_tokens":46206}}}
